543:   /**
544:    * Executes the provided, potentially asynchronous, {@link Action} with the promised value as input.
545:    * <p>
546:    * This method can be used when needing to perform an action with the promised value, without substituting the promised value.
547:    * That is, the exact same object provided to the given action will be propagated downstream.
